{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1883194976"}, "name":{"label":"Nick gì cũng dược"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-02T02:29:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"14.36.0"}, "id":{"label":"14618168776"}, "title":{"label":"System error"}, "content":{"label":"Very disappointing experience. I entered the correct traveler’s name, passport details and flight information when making a booking, but Agoda’s system confirmed the booking under my own name instead.\n\nI even tried booking again and the same issue happened, which strongly suggests a system problem rather than user error. However, customer service simply relied on the final system record, refused to correct the traveler’s name, and offered no meaningful investigation or solution.\n\nOf course I did not take screenshots of every step while booking because no normal customer expects to need evidence that they entered their information correctly.\n\nI have used Agoda before, but this experience seriously damaged my trust in the platform. When there is a possible system error, the customer should not simply be told that nothing can be done.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=440676901&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
